        {
            "title": "國際｜The Weeknd啟德開騷 梁朝偉劉嘉玲後台敘舊 兩周內二度碰面",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"國際｜The Weeknd啟德開騷 梁朝偉劉嘉玲後台敘舊 兩周內二度碰面\" class=\"rounded-lg\" height=\"502\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/c460bdd15af209a9761bf73d53273a284636b311b82e2c7142b9da3e93fc486b/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Ffortune_insight_694%2Fdbddec0f78d2a1ab4bc25a6950c04ffb.png\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption class=\"text-px14 text-dolphin mt-2 wrap-anywhere\" style=\"max-width:960px\">國際｜The Weeknd啟德開騷 梁朝偉劉嘉玲後台敘舊 兩周內二度碰面</figcaption></div></figure><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">加拿大歌手The Weeknd在啟德主場館舉行香港站演唱會，梁朝偉與太太劉嘉玲入場欣賞，並於完場後到後台與他搭膊合照。劉嘉玲在社交平台留言大讚演出精彩感人。雙方早於10月中已在香港私人飯敘，The Weeknd當時在餐牌上親筆致謝，其後上載與梁朝偉的合照時更以王菲《夢中人》作配樂。他自2022年展開的世界巡演，累計票房已突破10億美元（約78億港元），是男歌手個人巡演歷來最高紀錄。</p></div>",
            "link": "https://hk.news.yahoo.com/%E5%9C%8B%E9%9A%9B-weeknd%E5%95%9F%E5%BE%B7%E9%96%8B%E9%A8%B7-%E6%A2%81%E6%9C%9D%E5%81%89%E5%8A%89%E5%98%89%E7%8E%B2%E5%BE%8C%E5%8F%B0%E6%95%98%E8%88%8A-%E5%85%A9%E5%91%A8%E5%85%A7%E4%BA%8C%E5%BA%A6%E7%A2%B0%E9%9D%A2-190017509.html",
            "pub_date": "2026-10-31 03:08:25",
            "source": "yahoo_finance_asia",
            "kind": 1,
            "language": "zh-HK"
        },
        {
            "title": "本地｜黃子華復古造型現身澳牛 為新片《雨夜之徒》取景",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"本地｜黃子華復古造型現身澳牛 為新片《雨夜之徒》取景\" class=\"rounded-lg\" height=\"502\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/c460bdd15af209a9761bf73d53273a284636b311b82e2c7142b9da3e93fc486b/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Ffortune_insight_694%2Fdbddec0f78d2a1ab4bc25a6950c04ffb.png\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption class=\"text-px14 text-dolphin mt-2 wrap-anywhere\" style=\"max-width:960px\">本地｜黃子華復古造型現身澳牛 為新片《雨夜之徒》取景</figcaption></div></figure><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">黃子華正拍攝新電影《雨夜之徒》，劇組近日到佐敦老字號冰室澳洲牛奶公司取景，他穿啡色皮褸、灰色長褲，配及肩亂髮，造型復古。該片由歌手周殷廷首次執導、陳穎倫監製，靈感來自1980年代轟動香港的「雨夜屠夫」林過雲連環兇殺案，任達華及林雪亦有參演。開業56年的澳牛以炒蛋多士、燉奶及30秒上餐的「光速餐」聞名，至今只此一家。</p></div>",
            "link": "https://hk.news.yahoo.com/%E6%9C%AC%E5%9C%B0-%E9%BB%83%E5%AD%90%E8%8F%AF%E5%BE%A9%E5%8F%A4%E9%80%A0%E5%9E%8B%E7%8F%BE%E8%BA%AB%E6%BE%B3%E7%89%9B-%E7%82%BA%E6%96%B0%E7%89%87-%E9%9B%A8%E5%A4%9C%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%92-%E5%8F%96%E6%99%AF-180017989.html",
            "pub_date": "2026-10-31 02:11:32",
            "source": "yahoo_finance_asia",
            "kind": 1,
            "language": "zh-HK"
        },
        {
            "title": "聖路易斯聯儲行長稱有必要進一步加息 而且應該盡快行動",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">【彭博】-- 聖路易斯聯儲行長阿爾伯托·穆薩萊姆表示，需要進一步加息，以使通膨回到聯儲會的目標水平。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">「我認為有必要進一步收緊貨幣政策，而且要盡快，」穆薩萊姆周五為紐約影子公開市場委員會的活動準備的發言中表示。「更早地採取漸進式調整，通常比日後採取幅度更大且突然的行動造成的擾動更小。」</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">聯儲會官員本周早些時候以10票贊成、2票反對決定維持利率不變。在9月為應對高通膨而上調基準利率後，官員們希望留出時間評估經濟狀況。聯儲會主席凱文·沃什表示，在12月政策會議前公佈的一系列數據，應有助於官員判斷利率需要達到什麼水平，才能確保通膨及時回到2%的目標。</p><div class=\"bg-toast-background -mx-5 -mt-2 mb-3 pb-3 md:-mx-0 lg:mx-auto lg:w-[300px] lg:pb-0\"><div class=\"text-px14 text-gandalf py-1 text-center leading-5\">廣告</div><div class=\"mx-auto text-center min-w-[300px] min-h-[250px]\" id=\"sda-inbody-41c69d39-9ed9-3aa2-b0d6-5aa102f79238-1-iframe\"><div class=\"bg-dirty-seagull text-px12 text-dolphin mx-auto hidden items-center justify-center only:flex w-[300px] h-[250px]\">廣告</div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">今年沒有貨幣政策投票權的穆薩萊姆表示，利率在9月上調後仍顯寬鬆，而通膨風險「偏向於通膨持續高於目標」。</p><div class=\"recommendation-contents\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mb-2 h-[30px] w-[80px] rounded-lg\"></div><div class=\"no-scrollbar -mx-5 mb-5 flex overflow-hidden overflow-x-auto md:-mx-2 lg:mb-3.5\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mr-2 ml-5 h-[94px] w-[calc(85%-28px)] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg md:ml-2 md:w-[calc(85%-16px)] lg:w-[300px]\"></div><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mx-2 h-[94px] w-[85%] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:w-[300px]\"></div><div class=\"bg-marshmallow hidden h-[94px] w-[300px] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:block\"></div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">他說，金融環境近期有所收緊，部分原因是聯儲會的行動，但程度不及其他重大事件之後的變化。他表示，通膨預期迄今保持錨定。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">原文標題Fed's Musalem Says More Rate Hikes Needed Soon to Tame Inflation</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">More stories like this are available on <a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"bloomberg.com\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:bloomberg.com;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://www.bloomberg.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">bloomberg.com</a></p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">©2026 Bloomberg L.P.</p></div>",
